abstract: >-
  R code for the fully adjusted primary NHANES 2011–2014 analyses of
  individualised sleep-anchored MVPA timing with prevalent diabetes and
  glycaemic measures, including multiple imputation, outcome-specific
  complex-survey designs, Model 3 survey-weighted regression, and Rubin pooling.
